                                                "sense_id": "63a8cbb0-7841-3cc9-ae70-664576c12e54",
                                                "text": "Peregrine was in a little time a distinguished character, not only for his acuteness of apprehension, but also for that mischievous fertility of fancy, of which we have already given such pregnant examples."
